Package: aciR
Title: Assimilative Causal Inference for Conditional Gaussian Nonlinear
    Systems
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Max",
           family = "Moldovan",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "max.moldovan@gmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-9680-8474"))
Description: Implements assimilative causal inference (ACI) for conditional
    Gaussian nonlinear systems (CGNS). Provides the closed-form forward
    filter and backward smoother for the conditional Gaussian statistics of
    an unobserved component given an observed signal, together with the
    relative-entropy causal-information metric that contrasts the smoother
    posterior against the filter posterior. The method reimplements the
    approach of Andreou, Chen and Bollt (2026)
    <doi:10.1038/s41467-026-68568-0>.
